  "57a35bdd-c4a8-45ca-86fa-1df07c52cfdf"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the options a causal substrate is drawn with at a given size"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"1ac01d18-112d-4695-a099-9050784ea99b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
