 " \[LongDash] ",
 "the held code that builds a named causal substrate"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"a312b204-6880-4d63-89af-ce2baf270e65"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Random causal graphs", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"c9d9bc50-2526-4fb8-a1f6-9537082f36dd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
